Can we standardize the naming of these endpoints, and reorganize them so that the related ones are close to each other? Maybe sth like these?

```scala
A. Tenant RF profile
(1) GET /api/v1/advisory/edge/ringfencing/profile/tenants/{tenantId}
(2) POST /api/v1/advisory/edge/ringfencing/profile/tenants/{tenantId}
(3) POST /api/v1/advisory/edge/ringfencing/profile/tenants/copy

B. Resolved RF profile 
(1) GET /api/v1/advisory/edge/ringfencing/profile-summary/tenants/{tenantId}
(2) POST /api/v1/advisory/edge/ringfencing/profile-overview/tenants (multiple-tenant GET)

C. Resolved instrument ids
(1) GET /api/v1/advisory/edge/ringfencing/instruments/groups/{groupId}
(2) GET /api/v1/advisory/edge/ringfencing/instruments/tenants/{tenantId}

D. Group instrument summaries
(1) POST /api/v1/advisory/edge/ringfencing/instrument-summaries/groups/{groupId}
